  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>25</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>50</mn></msup></math>, then the value of&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>50</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo></math> is&nbsp;"
